<title>SWITZERLAND: Zurich September inflation unch at 0.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zurich September inflation unch at 0.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in Zurich rose 0.1 percent in September from the previous month for an unchanged year-on-year inflation rate of 0.6 percent, the Federal Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				   Sept 1996	Aug 1996     Sept 1995</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   +0.1 pct	+0.2 pct	+0.1 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+0.6 pct	+0.6 pct	+1.7 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	  102.9	   102.8	   102.2</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
